   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement",
     "texto": [
      "The colour agrees with the gender of the item of clothing: **czerwony sweter**, **czerwona koszula**.",
      "Like other adjectives, it changes with the noun."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The item of clothing as the object",
     "texto": [
      "With a feminine item of clothing as the object, the adjective also changes: **ta czerwona kurtka** («this red jacket») becomes **tę czerwoną kurtkę** («this red jacket», as the object).",
      "English forms don't change like this."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
